    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/0600f2d79816ab33e7a2587efb66e20f.avif?t=1743805984\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>You awaken on a mysterious spaceship amidst ruins and chaos. Systems are failing, and the dark corridors conceal lurking dangers. But what troubles you most is the strange voice echoing in your head. It calls to you, urging you to venture deeper into the ship, where scientists once conducted perilous experiments on consciousness.<br><br>Tsen\u2019tek of the Nyarlath race sought to unlock new potential for his species, willing to risk everything for this goal. But things didn\u2019t go as planned, and now he\u2019s lost control. Each corner ahead holds the consequences of his audacious experiments, but you press on. Explore the ship, make choices at critical moments, and witness how your decisions shape your fate and that of those around you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPROVISE TO SURVIVE</h2>The constant clash between human fragility and the creatures' relentless strength keeps you in suspense. Survival depends not just on your weapon but on mastering the perfect timing to dodge or block incoming attacks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/6b574de1d5b1c6f37a14f8b8dac51689.poster.avif?t=1743805984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/6b574de1d5b1c6f37a14f8b8dac51689.webm?t=1743805984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/6b574de1d5b1c6f37a14f8b8dac51689.mp4?t=1743805984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNRAVEL THE MYSTERIES OF NYARLATH\u2019S ALIEN SPACESHIP</h2>Immerse yourself in challenging puzzle sequences that demand both logic and creativity, to proceed with the story.<br>Dive into a variety of unique mini-games that are tied to the controls of spaceship devices.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/970668fc185ace3d3520c124b2d5145c.poster.avif?t=1743805984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/970668fc185ace3d3520c124b2d5145c.webm?t=1743805984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/970668fc185ace3d3520c124b2d5145c.mp4?t=1743805984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND YOUR FAVORITE GUN</h2>Confront enemies with versatile weapons crafted from salvaged materials, each featuring distinct functionalities\u2014unleash precise shots, wield overwhelming power at the risk of overheating, or freeze foes in their tracks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/d9ea0e9ef20b3b3cd13209a7f4c59883.poster.avif?t=1743805984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/d9ea0e9ef20b3b3cd13209a7f4c59883.webm?t=1743805984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/d9ea0e9ef20b3b3cd13209a7f4c59883.mp4?t=1743805984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTERACT WITH THE ENVIRONMENT</h2>This spaceship is a living ecosystem, where everything adheres to its designated purpose.<br>In a variety of extreme conditions, the inhabitants sustain the maintained functions.<br>Every interaction with these inhabitants will reveal both opportunities and threats.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/fee3dbb5ac1d8439900d225e54c3e9bd.poster.avif?t=1743805984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/fee3dbb5ac1d8439900d225e54c3e9bd.webm?t=1743805984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/fee3dbb5ac1d8439900d225e54c3e9bd.mp4?t=1743805984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE SPACESHIP'S SECRETS</h2>Discover the actively operating and strictly forbidden sections of the spaceship. Be prepared to crawl through the system of technical tunnels and mantle to uncover hidden paths.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/c8d3a96f7619e49542454255e6fbd7c8.poster.avif?t=1743805984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/c8d3a96f7619e49542454255e6fbd7c8.webm?t=1743805984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368030/extras/c8d3a96f7619e49542454255e6fbd7c8.mp4?t=1743805984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
